<title>FINLAND: UPM-Kymmene 1996 profit down 43 pct.</title>
<headline>UPM-Kymmene 1996 profit down 43 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	  3,555 vs 6,278</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		  10.24 vs 20.09</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		   4.50  vs same</p>
<p> Net sales					51,754  vs 54,738</p>
<p> Operating profit				5,591  vs 8,504</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of analysts' forecast was for a 1996 profit before extras of 3,700 million markka (mean 3,684 million) in a 2,650 to 4,436 million markka range.</p>
</text>
